"},{"en":"","sm":"talia"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"poto"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"sili"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"auro"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"aupito"},{"en":"","sm":"lelei."}]},{"en":"For wisdom is better than rubies; and all the things that may be desired are not to be compared to it.","n":11,"sm":"ii Auā e sili ona lelei le poto i penina; ma mea faafiafia uma lava e le tusa ma ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ii"},{"en":"","sm":"Auā"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"sili"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"lelei"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"poto"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"penina;"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"faafiafia"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tusa"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ia."}]},{"en":"I wisdom dwell with prudence, and find out knowledge of witty inventions.","n":12,"sm":"O aʻu o le poto, ma te mau ma le faautauta; ou te maua foi le poto i mafaufau.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"poto,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"mau"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faautauta;"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"maua"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"poto"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"mafaufau."}]},{"en":"The fear of the LORD is to hate evil: pride, and arrogancy, and the evil way, and the froward mouth, do I hate.","n":13,"sm":"O le mataʻu i le ALII, o le ʻinoʻino lea i le leaga; o le faamaualuga, ma le loto fefete, ma le amio leaga, ma le gutu faapiopio, ou te ʻinoʻino i ai.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mataʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ʻinoʻino"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"