e.","n":17,"sm":"Ou te alofa atu ia i latou o e alofa mai ia te au; o e sailiili mai foi ia te au, latou te maua aʻu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"alofa"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"alofa"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au;"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"sailiili"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au,"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"maua"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu."}]},{"en":"Riches and honour are with me; yea, durable riches and righteousness.","n":18,"sm":"O loo ia te au le oloa ma le mamalu; o le oloa anagata ma le amiotonu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"loo"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"oloa"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mamalu;"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"oloa"},{"en":"","sm":"anagata"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"amiotonu."}]},{"en":"My fruit is better than gold, yea, than fine gold; and my revenue than choice silver.","n":19,"sm":"O laʻu fua e sili ona lelei lea i le auro, o le auro lelei lava; o mea foi e tupu mai ia te au, e sili ona lelei ia i le ario sili.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"laʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"fua"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"sili"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"lelei"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"auro,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"auro"},{"en":"","sm":"lelei"},{"en":"","sm":"lava;"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"sili"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"lelei"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ario"},{"en":"","sm":"sili."}]},{"en":"I lead in the way of righteousness, in the midst of the paths of judgment:","n":20,"sm":"Ou te savali i le ala o le amiotonu, i magāala o le faamasinoga;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"savali"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ala"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"amiotonu,"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"magāala"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faamasinoga;"}]},{"en":"That I may cause those that love me to inherit substance; and I will fill their treasures.","n":21,"sm":"ina ia ou avatua le oloa i e ua alofa ia te au, ia fai mo latou; ou te faatumuina foi mea e teu ai o latou oa.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"avatua"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"oloa"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"alofa"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"mo"},{"en":"","sm":"latou;"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"faatumuina"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"teu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"oa."}]},{"en":"The LORD possessed me in the beginning of his way, before his works of old.","n":22,"sm":"O le Ate ona lava aʻu, o le amataga o lona ala, e muamua i ana galuega anamua.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Ate"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"amataga"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"ala,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"muamua"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ana"},{"en":"","sm":"galuega"},{"en":"","sm":"anamua."}]},{"en":"I was set up from everlasting, from the beginning, or ever the earth was.","n":23,"sm":"Na faauwna atu mai le vavau, mai le amataga, a O leai se lalolagi.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Na"},{"en":"","sm":"faauwna"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vavau,"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"amataga,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"leai"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"lalolagi."}]},{"en":"When there were no depths, I was brought forth; when there were no fountains abounding with water.","n":24,"sm":"Na fanaua au, a o leai ni mea loloto; a O leai foi ni puna e puna tele mai ai le vai;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Na"},{"en":"","sm":"fanaua"},{"en":"","sm":"au,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"leai"},{"en":"","sm":"ni"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"loloto;"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"leai"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"ni"},{"en":"","sm":"puna"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"puna"},{"en":"","sm":"tele"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vai;"}]},{"en":"Before the mountains were settled, before the hills was I brought forth:","n":25,"sm":"sa fanaua aʻu, a o lei faavaeina mauga, e leai foi ni mauga iti;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"sa"},{"en":"","sm":"fanaua"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lei"},{"en":"","sm":"faavaeina"},{"en":"","sm":"mauga,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"leai"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"ni"},{"en":"","sm":"mauga"},{"en":"","sm":"iti;"}]},{"en":"While as yet he had not made the earth, nor the fields, nor the highest part of the dust of the world.","n":26,"sm":"a o lei faia e ia le laueleele ma le vao, ma le tumutumu o le efu o le lalolagi.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lei"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"